The assignment specifies:

sigma_Rstar = 0.01 R_sun
sigma_depth = 0.002

For:

Rp = Rstar * sqrt(depth)

I propagated the independent uncertainties using:

sigma_Rp =
sqrt[
    (sqrt(depth) * sigma_Rstar)^2
    +
    (Rstar / (2 * sqrt(depth)) * sigma_depth)^2
]

